[% header('Māori stemming algorithm') %]

<h2>Links to resources</h2>

<ul>
[% algorithm_lis('maori', 'Māori') %]
</ul>

[% algorithm_vocab([30, 'ahiahi', 'whakapaingia']) %]

<h2>The stemming algorithm</h2>

<p>
Letters in Māori include the following accented forms:
</p>

<DL><DD>
    <B><I>ā  &nbsp;  ē &nbsp;  ī  &nbsp;  ō  &nbsp;  ū</I></B>
</DL>

<p>First, replace all diaecreses with macrons (diaereses were historically
used to indicate long vowels before Unicode support was widespread).</p>

<p>
The vowels are then
</p>

<DL><DD>
    <B><I>a  &nbsp;  e  &nbsp;  i  &nbsp;  o  &nbsp;  u  &nbsp  ā  &nbsp;  ē &nbsp;  ī  &nbsp;  ō  &nbsp;  ū</I></B>
</DL>

<p>
The algorithm removes suffixes for part of speech that are commonly used
in passive verb construction ("-tia", "-ngia", "-kia", "-mia", "-ria"
, "-whia", "-whāia", "-ia", "-ina", "-whina", "-kina", "-nga", "-na"
, "-a").</p>

